#   tau 0.509600   (stability floor 0.5; margin 9.60e-03)
#   Pe 128   M 1.250000e-02   phase omega 1.860465   (ceiling 2; margin 1.40e-01)
#   attack 20.0 deg   descent 15.0 deg   spin 0.640 U at the rim -> Omega 2.0000e-03 rad/step (1.22 rev over the run)
#   rotation free   spin on
